From: Daniel Illescas Romero <illescas.daniel@protonmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 16:42:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 53/64] E14 modes + Wayland fullscreen without GL recreate.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Expose higher r_vidModes and rebuild the Video Mode list from
r_availableModes; ignore ±2px Wayland resize noise; apply
fullscreen-only changes in-place so MangoHud does not SIGSEGV.
